WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.567 --> 00:00:03.534
-Good evening. I'm Seth Meyers.
This is "Late Night."

00:00:03.534 --> 00:00:05.534
We hope you're doing well,
and now, if you don't mind,

00:00:05.534 --> 00:00:06.701
we're gonna get to the news.

00:00:06.701 --> 00:00:08.300
The Biden administration
has reportedly warned

00:00:08.300 --> 00:00:09.801
that it will ban TikTok

00:00:09.801 --> 00:00:12.467
if its Chinese parent company
doesn't sell the app.

00:00:12.467 --> 00:00:14.501
Don't mess with this man.

00:00:14.501 --> 00:00:18.200
He has no use
for your addictive apps.

00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:20.000
Biden's the kind of guy
who can make it through

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:22.634
a whole two-week vacation
with nothing but a deck of cards

00:00:22.634 --> 00:00:25.267
and a print edition
of "Sports Illustrated."

00:00:25.267 --> 00:00:27.367
"You know what we're gonna do
during dinner tonight?

00:00:27.367 --> 00:00:31.634
We're actually gonna talk
to each other! That's what!"

00:00:31.634 --> 00:00:33.701
Treasury Secretary Janet Yellen
testified today

00:00:33.701 --> 00:00:35.300
before the
Senate Finance Committee

00:00:35.300 --> 00:00:38.334
and said the country's banking
system remains sound.

00:00:38.334 --> 00:00:40.067
Specifically this sound.

00:00:40.067 --> 00:00:41.234
[ Tires screech ]

00:00:41.234 --> 00:00:42.601
[ Crash, glass shatters ]

00:00:42.601 --> 00:00:45.267
[ Laughter ]

00:00:45.267 --> 00:00:47.033
The new CEO
of Silicon Valley Bank

00:00:47.033 --> 00:00:49.234
held a meeting yesterday
with venture capital

00:00:49.234 --> 00:00:51.033
and start-up clients and said,

00:00:51.033 --> 00:00:53.868
"There is no safer place
in the U.S. banking system

00:00:53.868 --> 00:00:55.334
to put your deposits."

00:00:55.334 --> 00:00:58.434
Plus, if you go now,
the lines are super-short!

00:00:58.434 --> 00:01:00.133
[ Laughter ]

00:01:00.133 --> 00:01:01.901
The Pentagon today
released footage

00:01:01.901 --> 00:01:04.667
of a Russian jet forcing down
a U.S. surveillance drone.

00:01:04.667 --> 00:01:07.434
Apparently what happened was
they both tried to take off

00:01:07.434 --> 00:01:09.834
from LaGuardia at the same time.

00:01:09.834 --> 00:01:11.701
[ Laughter ]

00:01:11.701 --> 00:01:13.801
U.N. officials
recently discovered

00:01:13.801 --> 00:01:17.200
during a routine inspection
that around 2.5 tons of uranium

00:01:17.200 --> 00:01:19.868
have gone missing in Libya,
which explains why

00:01:19.868 --> 00:01:24.167
Libya's beaches have experienced
a 600% increase in Godzillas.

00:01:24.167 --> 00:01:28.167
[ Laughter ]

00:01:28.167 --> 00:01:30.767
A zoo in Michigan
recently announced the birth

00:01:30.767 --> 00:01:33.033
of a critically endangered
bongo calf,

00:01:33.033 --> 00:01:35.100
which apparently is an animal

00:01:35.100 --> 00:01:38.234
and not a medical condition
suffered by Matthew McConaughey.

00:01:38.234 --> 00:01:39.968
[ Laughter ]

00:01:43.400 --> 00:01:44.834
[as McConaughey]
"I got it real bad.

00:01:44.834 --> 00:01:47.133
I got it real bad."

00:01:47.133 --> 00:01:49.300
The American Kennel Club
announced yesterday

00:01:49.300 --> 00:01:51.167
that the French Bulldog
has surpassed

00:01:51.167 --> 00:01:54.200
the Labrador Retriever
as the most popular dog breed.

00:01:54.200 --> 00:01:57.534
So you know what that means
for you Lab owners.

00:01:57.534 --> 00:02:01.834
-He was my dog. I'll do it.

00:02:01.834 --> 00:02:03.834
[ Laughter ]

00:02:09.801 --> 00:02:12.801
-So, our writer, Mike Scollins,
submitted that joke.

00:02:12.801 --> 00:02:14.534
And, look,
we didn't have to do it.

00:02:14.534 --> 00:02:15.667
[ Laughter ]

00:02:15.667 --> 00:02:17.300
You know,
I'm the host of the show.

00:02:17.300 --> 00:02:18.667
I could have just said
we're not doing it,

00:02:18.667 --> 00:02:20.234
but I wanted to do it
because I'm trying to teach him

00:02:20.234 --> 00:02:22.267
a lesson and --

00:02:22.267 --> 00:02:23.734
[ Laughter ]

00:02:23.734 --> 00:02:27.767
There's no -- The undergirding
logic of that makes no sense.

00:02:27.767 --> 00:02:30.400
That -- That implies
that everybody

00:02:30.400 --> 00:02:33.968
who's had a less-popular dog
until today

00:02:33.968 --> 00:02:35.534
had to put their dogs down.

00:02:35.534 --> 00:02:38.834
It doesn't -- Just 'cause the --
[ Sighs ]

00:02:38.834 --> 00:02:40.200
The important thing is,
you know,

00:02:40.200 --> 00:02:42.167
it's the start of the show,
you want to kick it off,

00:02:42.167 --> 00:02:43.767
you want to get a good vibe
in the room,

00:02:43.767 --> 00:02:45.767
and we showed a clip
from "Old Yeller," so...

00:02:45.767 --> 00:02:48.267
[ Laughter ]

00:02:48.267 --> 00:02:50.367
And, finally,
longtime Green bay Packers

00:02:50.367 --> 00:02:52.934
quarterback Aaron Rodgers
said yesterday that it is

00:02:52.934 --> 00:02:55.701
his intention to play next
season for the New York Jets.

00:02:55.701 --> 00:02:58.234
It's a perfect fit
because every week the Jets

00:02:58.234 --> 00:03:00.701
go out there intending
to play football.

00:03:00.701 --> 00:03:04.000
And that -- that's what's
waitin' for you here, buddy.

00:03:04.000 --> 00:03:05.334
That was a monologue.

00:03:05.334 --> 00:03:07.467
We've got a fantastic show
for you tonight.

